     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Hi all,</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">I am coding an app in which the user can define the number of columns in a matrix (note: the number of rows is hard-coded as a global variable, e.g. 2).</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">The user will then fill in this matrix one by one by pressing action buttons (i.e. after each button press, a number is filled into one coordinate of the matrix).</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">It sounds easy enough, but I can&#39;t seem to get it to work.</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Here is a minimal code example of what I have so far:</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">(Note: you will need the shinyjs package to enable/disable widgets -&gt; install.packages(&quot;shinyjs&quot;) &amp; library(shinyjs) )</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><b><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">ui.R</font></b></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Enable functionalities of shinyjs package</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  useShinyjs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  titlePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Test&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Choose number of columns in (reactive) matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;columns&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                  label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Columns&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                  choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                  selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Fill in next coordinate in matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;press&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                   label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Press&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Continue with next row in matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;next_row&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                   label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Next row&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Reset app</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;reset&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                   label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Reset&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>      plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plot&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></font></div></code></div><div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><b><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">server.R</font></b></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#800\">## Global variable for number of rows in matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>rows </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">## Reactive objects</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactiveValues</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactiveValues</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ncol </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$columns</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">## Toggle action buttons between active/nonactive when conditions </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">## are met or not respectively</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toggleState</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;press&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$columns</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                                </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$columns</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\">toggleState</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;next_row&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> row$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rows <br>                                   </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$columns</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">## Execute code when buttons are pressed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$press</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    disable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;columns&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># This disables the selectInput() widget to make sure you </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># cannot change the number of columns while filling in </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># the matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    col$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Increase column index by 1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    data_temp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Create temporary &#39;non-reactive&#39; matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    data_temp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">row$current</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col$current</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Fill in some value at the </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                                    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># specified column</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data_temp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$next_row</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    disable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;columns&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    row$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> row$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Increase row index by 1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    col$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Reset column index to 1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    data_temp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    data_temp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">row$current</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col$current</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data_temp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$reset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    row$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># reset row index</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    col$current </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># reset column index</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    enable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;columns&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Return (empty) matrix to console whenever you change the number of columns.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Just to show the dimensions.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$plot </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></font></div></code></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Notes:</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>1)</b> Everything is printed in the console, not in mainPanel()</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>2)</b> The first coordinate of the matrix [1, 1] won&#39;t be filled in. You may ignore this.</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>3)</b> When you choose 1 column, only the &#39;Next&#39; button will be available. This is part of the bigger plan, so you may ignore this as well. Just choose 5 columns, and click on Press/Next to get the idea :)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">I think the philosophy of the code should be:</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>1)</b> Create reactive matrix</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">E.g. [,1] [,2]</font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">[1,]  NA NA</font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">[2,]  NA NA</font></i></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>2)</b> Somehow transform reactive matrix to a &#39;non-reactive&#39; matrix for storing data (i.e. similar to the reactiveValues() function) and fill it in</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">E.g. [,1] [,2]</font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">[1,]    1    2</font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></i></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">[2,]    3    4</font></i></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>3)</b> Do analysis on the non-reactive matrix</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><i><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">E.g. sum of rows/columns</font></i></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">I already searched the internet for answers, but to no avail.</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">However, here are two discussions that helped me so far:</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>1)</b> <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/33651692/how-to-save-reactive-dataframe-as-non-reactive-in-shiny-r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/33651692/how-to-save-reactive-dataframe-as-non-reactive-in-shiny-r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395267840000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0KhBulUn1nF999HeiJ8qPb\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/33651692/how-to-save-reactive-dataframe-as-non-reactive-in-shiny-r</a></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">(Anybody know how isolate() could fit in my case?)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><b>2)</b> <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/p2eElm-XaqQ/PmMX34CrCFMJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/p2eElm-XaqQ/PmMX34CrCFMJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395267840000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2TK-Nv86qLS0jZttow9hTl\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/p2eElm-XaqQ/PmMX34CrCFMJ</a></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">and <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/p2eElm-XaqQ/5SRBJLedfh4J\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/p2eElm-XaqQ/5SRBJLedfh4J&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395267840000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QECuGYjlj1RnK7Tb2JlTB\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/p2eElm-XaqQ/5SRBJLedfh4J</a></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Looking forward to hearing from the community! :)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">Cheers</font></div></div>"
